# ./st setup expands the upstream patch stack here for Quilt. Only the Stead
# patch sources and their committed ordering belong in Git. Already tracked
# platform patches remain visible because ignore rules never hide tracked files.
patches/*
!patches/series
!patches/stead/
!patches/stead/**
